{"about_the_game":"Welcome to Final Dash, the electrifying platformer that takes you on an unforgettable journey through extraordinary worlds! Dive into a fast-paced experience filled with unique obstacles and breathtaking landscapes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Final Dash, not only will you face meticulously designed challenges, but you'll also have the chance to create your own levels using our intuitive editor. Unleash your creativity and build amazing worlds that will challenge your friends and the community at large!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore captivating environments, from futuristic landscapes to vibrant fantasy realms. Each level is meticulously crafted to provide visually stunning experiences and engaging gameplay that will test your reflexes and skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMoreover, in Final Dash, the community is at the heart of the experience. Share your creations with other players, play community-made levels, and compete for top scores on global leaderboards. The fun and excitement never end in Final Dash!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready for the ultimate challenge? Get ready to run, jump, and soar to greatness in Final Dash!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2845930?t=1757199367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845930/349f5bee48f6090fd6770efe07321a02f6350e96/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757199367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845930/2a851e4a6b08e925febc83bd677f540a18827ab8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757199367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845930/2a851e4a6b08e925febc83bd677f540a18827ab8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757199367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Welcome to Final Dash, the electrifying platformer that takes you on an unforgettable journey through extraordinary worlds! Dive into a fast-paced experience filled with unique obstacles and breathtaking landscapes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Final Dash, not only will you face meticulously designed challenges, but you'll also have the chance to create your own levels using our intuitive editor. Unleash your creativity and build amazing worlds that will challenge your friends and the community at large!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore captivating environments, from futuristic landscapes to vibrant fantasy realms. Each level is meticulously crafted to provide visually stunning experiences and engaging gameplay that will test your reflexes and skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMoreover, in Final Dash, the community is at the heart of the experience. Share your creations with other players, play community-made levels, and compete for top scores on global leaderboards. The fun and excitement never end in Final Dash!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready for the ultimate challenge? Get ready to run, jump, and soar to greatness in Final Dash!","developers":["Boot-Dark Games","Yoto Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845930/404cd43de82b4b8b06a5f8b7ea9cb555bce3858c/header.jpg?t=1757199367","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 10.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 300 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191379,